{"segs": ["PA_ja_11:0.4", "PA_ja_11:1.1", "PA_ja_11:1.2"], "en": "1. The Lakkhaṇa Deer Birth Story “There is benefit for those of virtuous conduct who live with hospitality;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
